('mission-morse-11', 'morse', 'mission', 'Radio Morse', 'decoding', 2, array['any','transmission','access','gate','observation','terrace']::text[], 'A Morse signal came over the squad radio. Scout copied it; Decoder holds letters A–M and Intel letters N–Z. Decode the word.', '{"scout":{"title":"Intercepted signal","body":"·−·   /   −−−   /   ··−   /   −   /   ·\n\n(5 letters, “/” separates letters)","mono":true,"big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Codebook A–M","body":"A ·−\nB −···\nC −·−·\nD −··\nE ·\nF ··−·\nG −−·\nH ····\nI ··\nJ ·−−−\nK −·−\nL ·−··\nM −−","mono":true},"intel":{"title":"Codebook N–Z","body":"N −·\nO −−−\nP ·−−·\nQ −−·−\nR ·−·\nS ···\nT −\nU ··−\nV ···−\nW ·−−\nX −··−\nY −·−−\nZ −−··","mono":true}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Decoded word","accept":["ROUTE"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, '· is a short beep, − is a long beep. Read one letter at a time and ask both codebooks.', '·−·=R −−−=O ··−=U −=T ·=E', null, 25, 'published'),
